<title>USA: Sled Dogs secures first unit of offering.</title>
<headline>Sled Dogs secures first unit of offering.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sled Dogs Co said Friday it secured the first $500,000 of its $1.5 million private loan unit offering.</p>
<p>Each unit of the offering includes a $50,000 convertible subordinated secured promissory note and a warrant to purchase 25,000 shares of Sled Dogs common stock.</p>
<p>The securities have not been registered under the Securities Act of 1933 and may not be offered or sold in the United States.</p>
<p>Sled Dogs probides snow skates and related accessories.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
